	"break_preset_neck_shoulder_stretch_title": "Neck & Shoulder Release",
	"break_preset_neck_shoulder_stretch_guide": "1. Gently tilt your right ear to your right shoulder for 30s.\n2. Repeat on the left side.\n3. Roll your shoulders backward in slow circles 5 times.",
	"break_preset_wrist_forearm_relief_title": "Wrist & Forearm Stretch",
	"break_preset_wrist_forearm_relief_guide": "1. Extend one arm forward with palm up and gently pull fingers down.\n2. Flip palm down and press back gently for 20s.\n3. Shake out both hands and repeat on other arm.",
	"break_preset_standing_backbend_reach_title": "Standing Backbend & Reach",
	"break_preset_standing_backbend_reach_guide": "1. Stand up and place your hands on your lower back.\n2. Gently arch backward while opening your chest and breathing deeply.\n3. Reach your arms high overhead and lengthen your spine.",
	"break_preset_quick_room_stroll_title": "Quick Room Stroll",
	"break_preset_quick_room_stroll_guide": "1. Step away from your desk and walk around your room or hallway.\n2. Swing your arms loosely to stimulate blood flow.\n3. Roll your ankles and shake out your legs before sitting down.",
	"break_preset_box_breathing_title": "Box Breathing Focus",
	"break_preset_box_breathing_guide": "1. Inhale deeply through your nose for 4 seconds.\n2. Hold your breath for 4 seconds.\n3. Exhale smoothly for 4 seconds and hold empty for 4 seconds. Repeat 4 times.",
	"break_preset_20_20_20_eye_rest_title": "20-20-20 Eye Rest",
	"break_preset_20_20_20_eye_rest_guide": "1. Look away from your screen toward an object at least 20 feet away.\n2. Keep your gaze relaxed on that distant point for 20 seconds.\n3. Blink slowly several times to re-moisturize your eyes.",
	"break_preset_sensory_grounding_title": "5-4-3-2-1 Sensory Grounding",
	"break_preset_sensory_grounding_guide": "1. Silently notice 3 things you can see around you.\n2. Notice 2 physical sensations you can feel.\n3. Notice 1 sound in your environment and take a deep breath.",
	"break_preset_mental_reset_title": "Mental Reset & Reflection",
	"break_preset_mental_reset_guide": "1. Close your eyes and let your shoulders drop away from your ears.\n2. Recall one small win or positive aspect from your work so far.\n3. Set a clear, calm intention for your next focus block.",
	"break_preset_glass_of_water_title": "Hydrate with Fresh Water",
	"break_preset_glass_of_water_guide": "1. Pour a full glass of cool or room-temperature water.\n2. Drink slowly across several mindful sips.\n3. Refill your bottle or cup so it is ready for your next session.",
	"break_preset_mindful_herbal_tea_title": "Mindful Herbal Tea",
	"break_preset_mindful_herbal_tea_guide": "1. Prepare a cup of hot water with herbal tea or lemon.\n2. Inhale the aroma and feel the warmth between your hands.\n3. Sip slowly without looking at screens.",
